    "question": "A net horizontal force acts on a particle of mass $4\\text{ kg}$ initially moving at $12\\text{ m/s}$, increasing its speed to $16\\text{ m/s}$. The work done by the net force on the particle is:",
    "options": {
      "A": "224.0 J",
      "B": "336.0 J",
      "C": "512.0 J",
      "D": "112.0 J"
    },
